			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761800401,
					"content": "以前都是到桑多涅的庭院去聚會，現在換成桑多涅妳到我的庭院來喝茶，感覺真新奇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800402,
					"content": "但茶和茶點還是我來準備，感覺也沒變多少…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800403,
					"content": "嗯，還是和以前一樣美味。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800404,
					"content": "#哼。不過，聽說{NICKNAME}也會經常來這邊看妳，{F#妳}{M#你}們這種時候都會幹嘛？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800405,
					"content": "#唔…有時會聊聊天，有時會和月靈一起玩遊戲、看月靈畫畫——哦，我還會和{M#他}{F#她}下月亮棋呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800406,
					"content": "#「月亮棋」？就是那種三個子連成一條線的遊戲？{F#妳}{M#你}們誰贏得多？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800407,
					"content": "#我沒有數過，但{NICKNAME}滿會下棋的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800408,
					"content": "哼哼，那妳是沒和我玩過。要來一局嗎？讓妳見識一下什麼是真正的厲害。平手算我輸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800409,
					"content": "好啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7618006,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7618004
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
